# Title: Renamed PAExec Execution
# ID: c4e49831-1496-40cf-8ce1-b53f942b02f9
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Jason Lynch
# Date: 2021-05-22
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1202
# Description: Detects execution of renamed version of PAExec. Often used by attackers
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((Description="PAExec Application") OR (process_name="PAExec.exe") OR (Product="*PAExec*") OR ((file_hash="*IMPHASH=11D40A7B7876288F919AB819CC2D9802*" OR file_hash="*IMPHASH=6444f8a34e99b8f7d9647de66aabe516*" OR file_hash="*IMPHASH=dfd6aa3f7b2b1035b76b718f1ddc689f*" OR file_hash="*IMPHASH=1a6cca4d5460b1710a12dea39e4a592c*"))) AND NOT (((process_path="*\\paexec.exe") OR (process_path="C:\\Windows\\PAExec-*"))))
